---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { localeHref } from '../../../../lib/i18n';

/*
 * 智慧財產權治理學習筆記。同時產出 /projects/one-more-step/ip-governance-ai/
 * 與 /en/ 版（i18n 遷移頁，見 [...lang]/writing/symbolic-reminder.astro）。
 *
 * 版面與 class 完全沿用遷移前的手刻頁，只把文字換成 t(zh, en)——
 * 這頁的 CSS 有 240 行自己的變數與斷點，動 HTML 結構的風險遠大於收益。
 *
 * ⚠ 人名、刊名與公司中文名保留原文並標 lang="zh-TW"。
 *   《全國律師》與「安卓樂資本」查不到官方英文名，音譯過去等於自己發明一個
 *   譯名——引用來源寫錯比留著原文糟。這與 hello-world 英文版保留人名的處理一致。
 */
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [{ params: { lang: undefined } }, { params: { lang: 'en' } }];
}

const isEn = Astro.currentLocale === 'en';
const t = (zh: string, en: string) => (isEn ? en : zh);

/* 不要在這裡加站名後綴：BaseLayout 會自動接上「· 葉淨維 Matt Ye」，
   自行加會變成 "… — Matt Ye · 葉淨維 Matt Ye"（署名重複兩次）。 */
const pageTitle = t(
  '智慧財產權對企業與治理的重要性 — One More Step',
  'IP Governance in the Age of AI — One More Step',
);
/* 英文 description 自己數長度（L1-DESC-LONG 上限 160 字元） */
const pageDescription = t(
  '探討人工智慧時代的智慧財產權治理架構，涵蓋著作權、專利、開源授權等核心議題。學習筆記整理自《全國律師》2026年5月號。',
  'An IP governance framework for the age of AI: copyright, patents, trade secrets, open-source licensing, valuation and cross-border strategy. Study notes.',
);

const canonicalURL = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).href;
const ogImage = new URL('/OG.png', Astro.site).href;

const articleLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": pageTitle,
  "description": pageDescription,
  "datePublished": "2026-05-01",
  "inLanguage": isEn ? "en" : "zh-TW",
  "author": { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://mattye.dev/#person", "name": "Ching-Wei (Matt) Ye" },
  "publisher": { "@id": "https://mattye.dev/#person" },
  "mainEntityOfPage": canonicalURL,
  "image": ogImage
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  lang={isEn ? 'en' : 'zh-TW'}
  ogType="article"
>

<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleLd)} />

<!-- Full-width: hero + sticky TOC -->
<div slot="full-width" class="ip-fw">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-label">📚 {t('學習筆記 · 智慧財產管理', 'Study notes · IP management')}</div>
    <h1>{t('智慧財產權對企業與治理的重要性', 'Why IP Decides the Fate of a Company')}</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      {t('從私募基金的角度談起　｜　作者：林家振', 'A private-equity perspective　｜　by ')}{isEn && <span lang="zh-TW">林家振</span>}
    </p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>{t('來源：《全國律師》2026年5月號', 'Source: ')}{isEn && <><span lang="zh-TW">全國律師</span>, May 2026</>}</span>
      <span>{t('10頁精華摘要', '10-page digest')}</span>
      <span>{t('5大章節', '5 chapters')}</span>
      <span>{t('AI時代必讀', 'Essential in the AI era')}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <nav class="toc-bar">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#overview">{t('總覽', 'Overview')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#s1">{t('一、IP重要性', '1. Why IP matters')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#s2">{t('二、保護機制', '2. Protection')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#s3">{t('三、交易實務', '3. Transactions')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#s4">{t('四、未來趨勢', '4. What is coming')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#s5">{t('五、台灣轉型', '5. Taiwan')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#terms">{t('關鍵術語', 'Glossary')}</a></li>
      <li><a href="#quiz">{t('自我測驗', 'Self-check')}</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</div>

<!-- Main content -->
<div class="ip-doc">

  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="overview">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">0</div>
      <h2>{t('文章總覽與核心論點', 'Overview and central claim')}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="highlight">
      <strong>{t('核心主張：', 'The central claim: ')}</strong>{t(
        '在 2026 年 AI 時代，智慧財產權（IP）已從法律防禦工具，升級為企業的「經濟護城河」、「價值放大器」與「經營權護盾」。誰能最好地治理、交易、保護與實現 IP 價值，誰就掌握競爭制高點。',
        'In the AI era of 2026, intellectual property has graduated from a legal shield into a company’s economic moat, value multiplier and defence of corporate control. Whoever governs, trades, protects and monetises IP best holds the high ground.',
      )}
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <h3>🎯 {t('學習目標', 'Learning objectives')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{t('理解 IP 在 AI 時代的戰略地位', 'Understand the strategic position of IP in the AI era')}</li>
          <li>{t('掌握內部 IP 保護機制的建立方式', 'Know how to build internal IP protection mechanisms')}</li>
          <li>{t('了解 IP 估值三大方法', 'Learn the three approaches to IP valuation')}</li>
          <li>{t('認識跨境 IP 管理的挑戰與對策', 'Recognise the challenges of cross-border IP management, and the responses')}</li>
          <li>{t('掌握新創公司 IP 建立的最佳實踐', 'Pick up the best practices for building IP in a startup')}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <h3>👤 {t('作者背景', 'About the author')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>Partner and chairman at <span lang="zh-TW">安卓樂資本</span>, a US venture capital firm</>
            : '美國安卓樂資本合夥人兼董事長'}</li>
          <li>{t('台灣大學管理學院兼任教授', 'Adjunct professor, College of Management, National Taiwan University')}</li>
          <li>{t('中研院生醫轉譯中心客座教授', 'Visiting professor, Biomedical Translation Research Center, Academia Sinica')}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '曾投資 Palantir、Anthropic、xAI、SpaceX、Stripe、Databricks、Figure AI 等',
            'Investor in Palantir, Anthropic, xAI, SpaceX, Stripe, Databricks and Figure AI, among others',
          )}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr>
          <th>{t('章節', 'Chapter')}</th>
          <th>{t('主題', 'Topic')}</th>
          <th>{t('核心問題', 'Central question')}</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>{t('壹', 'I')}</td><td>{t('IP 重要性', 'Why IP matters')}</td><td>{t('IP 為何決定企業命運？', 'Why does IP decide a company’s fate?')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('貳', 'II')}</td><td>{t('保護與管理機制', 'Protection and management')}</td><td>{t('如何系統性保護 IP？', 'How do you protect IP systematically?')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('參', 'III')}</td><td>{t('智財交易實務', 'IP transactions in practice')}</td><td>{t('IP 如何定價與交易？', 'How is IP priced and traded?')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('肆', 'IV')}</td><td>{t('未來趨勢與監管挑戰', 'Trends and regulatory challenges')}</td><td>{t('2026–2030 年的 IP 戰場？', 'Where is the IP battleground in 2026–2030?')}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('伍', 'V')}</td><td>{t('台灣企業轉型路徑', 'The path for Taiwanese companies')}</td><td>{t('台灣如何從硬體強國轉型？', 'How does Taiwan move beyond hardware?')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 1 -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="s1">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">1</div>
      <h2>{t('智慧財產對企業與公司治理的重要性', 'Why IP matters to the business and to the board')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>{t('一句話摘要：', 'In one sentence: ')}</strong>{t(
        'IP 是企業的「生命線」、「價值放大器」與「經營權護盾」——從 Palantir 的數千項專利到 AI 模型參數，IP 治理優劣直接決定企業估值與生存能力。',
        'IP is a company’s lifeline, value multiplier and defence of control — from Palantir’s thousands of patents to the parameters of an AI model, how well IP is governed feeds straight through to valuation and survival.',
      )}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title">▍{t('AI 產業價值鏈中的 IP 密度', 'IP density along the AI value chain')}</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr>
          <th>{t('層次', 'Layer')}</th>
          <th>{t('代表技術', 'Representative technology')}</th>
          <th>{t('IP 類型', 'IP type')}</th>
          <th>{t('IP 強度', 'IP intensity')}</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>{t('硬體系統', 'Hardware')}</td><td>{t('GPU、TPU、LPU 晶片', 'GPU, TPU and LPU chips')}</td><td>{t('專利、積體電路布局', 'Patents, IC layout rights')}</td><td>★★★</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('雲端服務', 'Cloud services')}</td><td>AWS, Azure, GCP</td><td>{t('商標、服務授權', 'Trademarks, service licensing')}</td><td>★★</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('基礎模型', 'Foundation models')}</td><td>GPT, Claude, Grok</td><td>{t('著作權、營業秘密、專利', 'Copyright, trade secrets, patents')}</td><td>★★★★★</td></tr>
          <tr><td>{t('AI 代理應用', 'AI agent applications')}</td><td>{t('多模型代理、企業整合', 'Multi-model agents, enterprise integration')}</td><td>{t('整合 IP、資料授權', 'Integration IP, data licensing')}</td><td>★★★★★</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="table-note">{isEn
      ? <>The software end — models, applications and AI agents — often produces <strong>more than ten times</strong> the value of hardware, and it is where IP is most concentrated.</>
      : <>軟體端（模型＋應用＋AI代理）產值往往是硬體的 <strong>10 倍以上</strong>，是 IP 最密集的領域。</>}</p>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:24px;">▍{t('IP 治理不善的四大風險', 'Four risks of poor IP governance')}</h3>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag red">{t('風險 1', 'Risk 1')}</span>
        <h3>{t('侵權訴訟巨資', 'Ruinous infringement litigation')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '案例：Apple vs. Samsung 訴訟長達數年，成本數億美元。IP 歸屬不清導致訴訟纏身。',
          'Apple v. Samsung ran for years and cost hundreds of millions of dollars. Unclear ownership is what keeps a company in court.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag red">{t('風險 2', 'Risk 2')}</span>
        <h3>{t('併購破局', 'Deals that collapse')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '輝達收購 Arm 失敗，部分原因為 IP 集中引發反壟斷監管疑慮。',
          'Nvidia’s acquisition of Arm fell through, in part because concentrating that much IP raised antitrust concerns.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag red">{t('風險 3', 'Risk 3')}</span>
        <h3>{t('經營權爭奪敗北', 'Losing a control contest')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '敵意收購時公司忽略 IP 轉移風險與營業秘密保護，導致經營權失守。',
          'In a hostile takeover, a company that has ignored IP transfer risk and trade-secret protection loses control of itself.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag red">{t('風險 4', 'Risk 4')}</span>
        <h3>{t('新創估值被低估', 'Startups valued below what they are worth')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '台灣多起新創因 IP 歸屬不明、營業秘密外洩，導致投資人撤資或交易卡關。',
          'Several Taiwanese startups have seen investors walk away, or deals stall, over unclear IP ownership and leaked trade secrets.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <strong>{t('創投基金視角：', 'From a VC’s side of the table: ')}</strong>{isEn
        ? <>the first step of due diligence is to review how complete the IP management structure is, how well it defends across borders, and how mature its compliance is. IP work often accounts for <strong>more than 30%</strong> of the whole diligence effort.</>
        : <>盡職調查第一步即審核 IP 管理架構的完整性、跨境防禦能力與合規成熟度。IP 盡調工作佔比往往超過 <strong>30%</strong>。</>}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:24px;">▍{t('AI 時代的 IP 新挑戰', 'New IP questions the AI era raises')}</h3>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('著作權歸屬', 'Who owns the copyright')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '生成式 AI 所產生內容的著作權歸屬（人、AI、訓練資料提供者）如何認定？',
            'When generative AI produces something, who holds the copyright — the person, the model, or whoever supplied the training data?',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('訓練資料合法性', 'Whether the training data was lawful')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '巨量訓練資料是否侵犯既有著作權？需保留完整授權鏈紀錄。',
            'Does a vast training corpus infringe existing copyright? You need to keep the full chain of licences on record.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('開源模型授權合規', 'Open-source licence compliance')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            'GPL「病毒式」污染風險：若開源組件混入商業模型，可能導致整個模型被迫開源。',
            'The “viral” reach of the GPL: let an open-source component into a commercial model and the whole model may have to be released as open source.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('AI 代理整合 IP', 'IP inside an AI agent')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '代理需調用多模型與企業私有資料，其 IP 保護涉及多方授權鏈，歸屬複雜。',
            'An agent calls several models and reaches into private company data, so its IP sits on a chain of licences from multiple parties — ownership gets complicated.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2 -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="s2">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">2</div>
      <h2>{t('智財保護與管理機制', 'Protecting and managing IP')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>{t('一句話摘要：', 'In one sentence: ')}</strong>{t(
        'IP 保護需從「人員保密」、「資料控制」、「AI 特定流程」、「跨境布局」四個維度系統化建立，並以 TIPS 驗證為基準升級治理成熟度。',
        'Build protection systematically along four axes — people and confidentiality, data control, AI-specific process, and cross-border coverage — and use TIPS certification as the benchmark for governance maturity.',
      )}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title">▍{t('內部管理：四大核心措施', 'Inside the company: four core measures')}</h3>

    <details>
      <summary>{t('① 員工與合作夥伴保密體系', '① Confidentiality across staff and partners')}</summary>
      <div class="details-body">
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>Every employee signs a comprehensive <strong>NDA</strong> on day one, covering patents, trade secrets, training data, model parameters and generated output</>
            : <>所有員工入職即簽署全面 <strong>NDA（保密協議）</strong>，涵蓋專利、營業秘密、訓練資料、模型參數與生成內容</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>On departure, enforce the <strong>non-compete clause</strong>, recover every storage device, and run an exit interview plus an inventory of knowledge assets</>
            : <>離職時強制執行<strong>競業禁止條款</strong>、歸還所有資料載體、進行離職面談與知識資產清點</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>Executives and core R&D staff sign an <strong>IP assignment agreement</strong>, so that inventions made in the course of employment vest in the company automatically</>
            : <>高階主管與核心研發人員簽訂「<strong>智慧財產權讓與協議</strong>」，確保職務發明自動歸屬公司</>}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{t('② 資料存取與加密控制', '② Access control and encryption')}</summary>
      <div class="details-body">
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>Work on <strong>need-to-know</strong>, and narrow permissions through <strong>RBAC</strong> (role-based access control)</>
            : <>採用「<strong>最小必要原則</strong>（need-to-know）」，透過 <strong>RBAC（角色基礎存取控制）</strong>系統限縮權限</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>All sensitive material — training sets, model weights, proprietary algorithms — must be <strong>encrypted at rest</strong></>
            : <>所有敏感資料（訓練資料集、模型權重、專有演算法）須<strong>加密儲存</strong></>}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '使用版本控制系統（如 Git with LFS）追蹤變更，並定期進行存取日誌審核',
            'Track changes in version control (Git with LFS, for instance) and audit the access logs on a schedule',
          )}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{t('③ AI 特定保護流程', '③ Process built specifically for AI')}</summary>
      <div class="details-body">
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>Keep a <strong>data provenance register</strong> for training sets, recording the licence, the de-identification record and the share of synthetic data for every source</>
            : <>訓練資料集需建立「<strong>資料來源登記冊</strong>」，記錄每筆資料的授權合約、去識別化紀錄與合成資料比例</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <>The moment training finishes, apply <strong>watermarking</strong> or fingerprinting so a leak can be traced back</>
            : <>模型訓練完成後，立即進行「<strong>水印嵌入</strong>」或「指紋技術」以追蹤外洩來源</>}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '生成內容需自動標記「AI 生成」標籤，避免著作權爭議',
            'Label generated output as AI-produced automatically, to head off copyright disputes',
          )}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{t('④ 內部審計與教育訓練', '④ Internal audit and training')}</summary>
      <div class="details-body">
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <><strong>Two full IP audits a year</strong> at minimum, covering patent validity, trademark use, and how well trade-secret protection is actually being followed</>
            : <>每年至少<strong>兩次全面 IP 審計稽查</strong>，涵蓋專利有效性、商標使用狀況、營業秘密保護執行率</>}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '推行全公司 IP 意識訓練課程（線上＋實體），針對研發、業務、行銷部門分級設計',
            'Run company-wide IP awareness training, online and in person, pitched differently for R&D, sales and marketing',
          )}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '研發人員重點學習營業秘密保護；業務人員學習商標使用規範',
            'R&D focuses on trade-secret protection; sales focuses on the rules for using trademarks',
          )}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('跨境管理：四大應對策略', 'Across borders: four strategies')}</h3>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('策略一', 'Strategy 1')}</span>
        <h3>{t('全球 IP 地圖繪製', 'Map the global portfolio')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '每年更新全球專利與商標布局地圖，優先在美、歐、中、日、韓、台同步申請核心技術。使用 PCT 途徑可延長決策時間並降低初期成本。',
          'Refresh the global patent and trademark map every year, filing core technology in the US, Europe, China, Japan, Korea and Taiwan in parallel. The PCT route buys decision time and lowers the cost up front.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('策略二', 'Strategy 2')}</span>
        <h3>{t('跨境合約模板標準化', 'Standardise cross-border contracts')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '所有國際合作、授權、併購合約預設 WIPO 仲裁條款，選擇新加坡或香港作為仲裁地。合約明確「背景 IP」與「前景 IP」歸屬。',
          'Default every international collaboration, licence and acquisition contract to a WIPO arbitration clause, seated in Singapore or Hong Kong — and state plainly who owns the background IP and who owns the foreground IP.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('策略三', 'Strategy 3')}</span>
        <h3>{t('風險監控與應變機制', 'Monitor risk, and have a plan')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '建立跨境 IP 風險雷達系統，監測主要市場法規變動。一旦偵測風險，立即啟動應急計畫，包括暫停資料傳輸、啟動本地化儲存或尋求 WIPO 快速調解。',
          'Run a radar on regulatory change in your main markets. When it picks something up, trigger the contingency plan: suspend data transfers, switch to local storage, or go to WIPO for expedited mediation.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('策略四', 'Strategy 4')}</span>
        <h3>{t('營業秘密跨境保護', 'Protect trade secrets across borders')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '利用美國 DTSA 與歐盟 Trade Secrets Directive 的強制執行力。將核心模型參數拆分儲存（部分在美國雲端、部分本地化），降低單一洩漏風險。',
          'Lean on the enforcement teeth of the US DTSA and the EU Trade Secrets Directive. Split core model parameters across locations — some in US cloud, some kept local — so no single leak takes everything.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('TIPS 台灣智慧財產管理制度', 'TIPS: Taiwan Intellectual Property Management System')}</h3>
    <div class="ip-card">
      <p>{isEn
        ? <>As of 2026, more than <strong>150 companies</strong> have passed TIPS certification. Grade-A companies score on average <strong>over 25% higher</strong> in corporate governance evaluations.</>
        : <>截至 2026 年，已有超過 <strong>150 家企業</strong>通過 TIPS 驗證。A 級企業在公司治理評鑑中平均得分高出 <strong>25% 以上</strong>。</>}</p>
      <br />
      <p><strong>{t('建議 KPI 目標：', 'Suggested KPI targets:')}</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin-top:8px;">
        <li>{t('年度專利申請件數成長率 ＞ 20%', 'Annual growth in patent filings above 20%')}</li>
        <li>{t('營業秘密外洩事件為零', 'Zero trade-secret leaks')}</li>
        <li>{t('AI 資料合規審核通過率 ＞ 98%', 'AI data compliance review pass rate above 98%')}</li>
        <li>{t('IP 貢獻營收比例逐年提升', 'A rising share of revenue attributable to IP, year on year')}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3 -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="s3">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">3</div>
      <h2>{t('智財交易實務', 'IP transactions in practice')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>{t('一句話摘要：', 'In one sentence: ')}</strong>{t(
        'IP 交易核心在於「估值方法選擇」→「財務揭露」→「授權合約設計」，三法加權估值是談判基礎，AI 時代需額外加入資料合規與開源風險條款。',
        'An IP deal runs from choosing a valuation method, through financial disclosure, to drafting the licence. A weighted blend of the three approaches is the basis for negotiation — and in the AI era you add clauses on data compliance and open-source risk.',
      )}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title">▍{t('IP 估值三大方法比較', 'The three valuation approaches, compared')}</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>{t('方法', 'Approach')}</th>
            <th>{t('核心邏輯', 'Core logic')}</th>
            <th>{t('AI 時代適用場景', 'Where it fits in the AI era')}</th>
            <th>{t('優點', 'Strengths')}</th>
            <th>{t('缺點', 'Weaknesses')}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{t('成本法', 'Cost')}</strong><br />{t('Cost Approach', 'approach')}</td>
            <td>{t('計算歷史研發投入、重置成本、機會成本', 'Adds up historical R&D spend, replacement cost and opportunity cost')}</td>
            <td>{t('早期新創、AI 訓練資料集蒐集成本', 'Early-stage startups; the cost of assembling an AI training set')}</td>
            <td>{t('客觀、資料易取得', 'Objective, and the numbers are easy to obtain')}</td>
            <td>{t('忽略未來收益潛力，AI 爆發期常低估', 'Ignores future earning potential — in an AI boom it usually undershoots')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{t('市場法', 'Market')}</strong><br />{t('Market Approach', 'approach')}</td>
            <td>{t('比對類似 IP 交易案例，調整相似度係數', 'Compares similar IP deals and adjusts for how close the comparison is')}</td>
            <td>{t('成熟 AI 公司、參考 Anthropic/Databricks 授權案', 'Mature AI companies; benchmarking against Anthropic or Databricks licensing deals')}</td>
            <td>{t('市場導向、談判有憑據', 'Market-anchored, and gives you something to point at in negotiation')}</td>
            <td>{t('需有足夠可比交易案例', 'Needs enough comparable transactions to exist')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{t('收益法', 'Income')}</strong><br />{t('Income Approach', 'approach')}</td>
            <td>{t('DCF 模型預估未來收益，考慮 WACC、終值倍數', 'A DCF of future earnings, with WACC and a terminal multiple')}</td>
            <td>{isEn ? <>AI agents and edge-computing IP (CAGR &gt; 40%)</> : <>AI 代理、邊緣運算 IP（CAGR &gt; 40%）</>}</td>
            <td>{t('最能反映 AI IP 潛力，最常用', 'Reflects the upside of AI IP best; the one most often used')}</td>
            <td>{t('參數假設影響大，需 Monte Carlo 模擬', 'Highly sensitive to assumptions — run a Monte Carlo simulation')}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="ip-card" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <h3>📊 {t('收益法關鍵參數（AI IP）', 'Key parameters for the income approach (AI IP)')}</h3>
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:10px;">
        <div><span class="tag green">CAGR</span> {isEn ? <>AI agents and edge computing, <strong>&gt; 40%</strong></> : <>AI 代理與邊緣運算市場 <strong>&gt; 40%</strong></>}</div>
        <div><span class="tag green">{t('毛利率', 'Gross margin')}</span> {isEn ? <>typically <strong>60–80%</strong> on the software side</> : <>軟體端通常 <strong>60–80%</strong></>}</div>
        <div><span class="tag amber">WACC</span> {isEn ? <>a discount rate of <strong>12–18%</strong>, covering technical risk and regulatory uncertainty</> : <>風險折現率 <strong>12–18%</strong>（含技術風險與監管不確定性）</>}</div>
        <div><span class="tag amber">{t('終值倍數', 'Terminal multiple')}</span> {isEn ? <>AI companies often reach <strong>20–40× EBITDA</strong></> : <>AI 企業常達 <strong>20–40 倍 EBITDA</strong></>}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('授權與轉讓：關鍵條款', 'Licensing and assignment: the clauses that matter')}</h3>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <h3>{t('背景 IP vs. 前景 IP', 'Background IP vs. foreground IP')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <><strong>Background IP:</strong> technology that existed before signing; normally stays with its original owner</>
            : <><strong>背景 IP：</strong>簽約前既有技術，通常由原所有方保留</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn
            ? <><strong>Foreground IP:</strong> created during the collaboration; ownership has to be spelled out</>
            : <><strong>前景 IP：</strong>合作期間新創技術，歸屬需明確約定</>}</li>
          <li>{t(
            '大學/研究機構常保留背景 IP 所有權，但授予企業獨佔商業化權',
            'Universities and research institutes usually keep the background IP but grant the company exclusive commercialisation rights',
          )}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <h3>{t('AI 域特殊條款', 'Clauses specific to AI')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{isEn ? <><strong>AI compliance representations and warranties</strong></> : <><strong>AI 合規陳述與保證</strong>條款</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn ? <><strong>Data provenance</strong> clauses (required by GDPR and the AI Act)</> : <><strong>資料溯源條款</strong>（GDPR/AI Act 要求）</>}</li>
          <li>{isEn ? <>A <strong>model freeze clause</strong>, to block unauthorised modification</> : <><strong>模型凍結機制（freeze clause）</strong>防止未經授權修改</>}</li>
          <li>{t('開源污染聲明與 GPL 合規保證', 'An open-source contamination statement and a GPL compliance warranty')}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('新創企業 IP 建立六步驟', 'Building startup IP in six steps')}</h3>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('從發想階段啟動保護', 'Start protecting at the idea stage')}</h4>
          <p>{isEn
            ? <>The founding team signs mutual NDAs and invention assignment agreements. If you are filing in the US, a <strong>provisional patent</strong> locks in the priority date cheaply and buys twelve months of breathing room.</>
            : <>核心團隊簽署相互 NDA、職務發明讓與協議；考慮美國布局可申請<strong>臨時專利</strong>（Provisional Patent）鎖定優先日，成本低、爭取 12 個月緩衝期。</>}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('專利布局', 'Lay out the patents')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '優先保護 AI 演算法、應用方法、硬體整合。初期可採「防禦性公開（defensive publication）」避免他人搶先專利化。',
            'Cover AI algorithms, methods of application and hardware integration first. Early on, a defensive publication stops someone else from patenting it ahead of you.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('營業秘密保護', 'Protect the trade secrets')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '嚴格落實員工保密協議、資料加密、離職審核、必要知悉範圍限縮。AI 模型參數與訓練流程最適用營業秘密保護。',
            'Enforce the NDAs, encrypt the data, review departures, keep the need-to-know circle small. Model parameters and training pipelines are the things trade-secret protection suits best.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('商標與著作權', 'Trademarks and copyright')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '及早註冊品牌商標、軟體著作權登記。開源專案需審核授權條款，避免 GPL 病毒式污染。',
            'Register the brand and the software copyright early. Review the licence terms on any open-source project you pull in, so GPL contamination does not spread into your product.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('資料 IP 管理', 'Manage data as IP')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '建立資料來源登記冊，優先使用公開資料集或合法授權資料，導入合成資料以降低個別侵權風險。',
            'Keep a provenance register, prefer public or properly licensed datasets, and bring in synthetic data to reduce exposure on any single source.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">6</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('建立 IP 資料室', 'Build the IP data room')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '委託外部專利事務所或加入 TIPS 新創輔導計畫。聘請律師提前建立「IP 資料室（data room）」，包含清單、合約、審計報告，大幅提升募資吸引力。',
            'Bring in an outside patent firm, or join the TIPS startup programme. Have counsel assemble the data room in advance — inventory, contracts, audit reports — and you become markedly easier to fund.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight" style="margin-top:8px;">
      <strong>{t('Scale AI 案例：', 'Scale AI: ')}</strong>{t(
        '從創立時即布局資料 IP，市值快速衝至百億美元。反之，忽略 IP 的新創公司常在 A 輪或併購時被大幅壓低估值。',
        'it laid out its data IP from day one and reached a valuation in the tens of billions. Startups that ignore IP, by contrast, tend to get marked down hard at Series A or on acquisition.',
      )}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 4 -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="s4">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">4</div>
      <h2>{t('AI 時代 IP 治理的未來趨勢與全球監管挑戰', 'Where IP governance is heading, and what regulators will demand')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>{t('一句話摘要：', 'In one sentence: ')}</strong>{t(
        '2026–2030 年，生成式 AI 市場將從數千億擴張至萬億美元，軟體端貢獻 80% 以上價值；中美脫鉤、歐盟 AI Act、量子運算 IP 爆發，將迫使企業建立「AI IP 治理藍圖」。',
        'Between 2026 and 2030 the generative-AI market grows from hundreds of billions to trillions of dollars, with software contributing over 80% of the value. US–China decoupling, the EU AI Act and a surge in quantum-computing IP will force companies to draw up an AI IP governance blueprint.',
      )}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title">▍{t('四大未來 IP 趨勢', 'Four trends')}</h3>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('趨勢 1', 'Trend 1')}</span>
        <h3>{t('IP 與 AI 倫理／透明度整合', 'IP folded into AI ethics and transparency')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '歐盟 AI Act 要求高風險 AI 系統公開訓練資料來源與演算法邏輯。企業需建置「AI IP 透明度報告」，涵蓋資料溯源、偏誤審核與生成內容標記。',
          'The EU AI Act requires high-risk systems to disclose training-data sources and algorithmic logic. Companies will need an AI IP transparency report covering provenance, bias review and labelling of generated content.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('趨勢 2', 'Trend 2')}</span>
        <h3>{t('量子與邊緣運算 IP 爆發', 'A surge in quantum and edge-computing IP')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '量子運算專利申請量 2026 年預計成長 50%。IP 治理需從雲端轉向分散式保護，採用區塊鏈溯源確保模型參數在邊緣裝置的安全傳輸。',
          'Quantum-computing patent filings are expected to grow 50% in 2026. Governance has to move from the cloud to distributed protection, using on-chain provenance to keep model parameters safe in transit to edge devices.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('趨勢 3', 'Trend 3')}</span>
        <h3>{t('開源與專有 IP 混合模式', 'Open source and proprietary IP, mixed')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          'Meta Llama 與 xAI Grok 的開源策略顯示，未來 IP 治理將平衡「開放創新」與「專有保護」。企業需精通 Apache/MIT/GPL 授權條款差異。',
          'What Meta did with Llama and xAI with Grok shows where this goes: governance balanced between open innovation and proprietary protection. You need to know exactly how Apache, MIT and GPL terms differ.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag">{t('趨勢 4', 'Trend 4')}</span>
        <h3>{t('腦機介面與生物 IP 交叉', 'Where brain–computer interfaces meet biological IP')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          'Neuralink 式技術將 IP 從數位延伸至生物領域，涵蓋神經資料著作權與倫理專利。腦波資料的個人 IP 歸屬、FDA 與 USPTO 跨域合規成為新挑戰。',
          'Neuralink-style technology extends IP from the digital into the biological — copyright in neural data, patents with ethical dimensions. Who owns an individual’s brainwave data, and how you comply with the FDA and the USPTO at once, become live questions.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('五大全球監管挑戰', 'Five regulatory challenges')}</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr>
          <th>#</th>
          <th>{t('監管挑戰', 'Regulatory challenge')}</th>
          <th>{t('企業因應措施', 'What companies should do')}</th>
          <th>{t('時程', 'Timing')}</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>1</td>
            <td>{isEn
              ? <><strong>US–China decoupling and export controls</strong><br />The US CHIPS Act and China’s Export Control Law both restrict transfers of AI IP</>
              : <><strong>中美脫鉤與出口管制</strong><br />美國 CHIPS Act + 中國《出口管制法》限制 AI IP 轉移</>}</td>
            <td>{t('建置「雙軌 IP 體系」（美系與中系分離）', 'Run a dual-track IP system, with the US and China sides kept separate')}</td>
            <td>{t('現在', 'Now')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>2</td>
            <td>{isEn
              ? <><strong>Risk tiering under the EU AI Act</strong><br />High-risk AI needs CE marking and IP disclosure; fines reach 4% of global revenue</>
              : <><strong>歐盟 AI Act 分級監管</strong><br />高風險 AI 需 CE 標記與 IP 揭露；罰款高達全球營收 4%</>}</td>
            <td>{t('提前合規審核，出口歐盟產品需符合 AI Act 分級要求', 'Review compliance ahead of time; anything exported to the EU has to meet its risk tier')}</td>
            <td>2025–2027</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>3</td>
            <td>{isEn
              ? <><strong>WIPO’s global AI IP guidance</strong><br />Emphasises fair licensing and technology transfer to developing countries</>
              : <><strong>WIPO 全球 AI IP 指南</strong><br />強調「公平授權」與「發展中國家技術轉移」</>}</td>
            <td>{t('參與國際標準制定，避免被邊緣化', 'Take part in setting the standards rather than being standardised around')}</td>
            <td>{t('2027 年', '2027')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>4</td>
            <td>{isEn
              ? <><strong>ESG and IP converging</strong><br />ESG reports will have to carry an IP governance score, under the social pillar</>
              : <><strong>ESG 與 IP 連結深化</strong><br />ESG 報告強制納入 IP 治理分數（社會責任構面）</>}</td>
            <td>{t('將 IP 治理納入 ESG 框架，防止投資人撤資', 'Fold IP governance into the ESG framework, before investors walk')}</td>
            <td>{t('2028 年起', 'From 2028')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>5</td>
            <td>{isEn
              ? <><strong>Geopolitical risk</strong><br />Data sovereignty disputes sharpen, and supply-chain resilience suffers</>
              : <><strong>地緣政治風險</strong><br />資料主權爭議加劇，供應鏈韌性受威脅</>}</td>
            <td>{t('分散資料儲存、本地化專利布局', 'Distribute data storage; localise the patent filings')}</td>
            <td>{t('持續', 'Ongoing')}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 5 -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="s5">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num">5</div>
      <h2>{t('台灣企業 IP 治理轉型路徑', 'A transition path for Taiwanese companies')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>{t('核心目標：', 'The goal: ')}</strong>{t(
        '台灣需從「硬體製造強國」轉型為「軟體應用、價值創造與創新領導者」。IP 治理是這場轉型的關鍵槓桿。',
        'Taiwan has to move from being a hardware manufacturing power to leading on software, value creation and innovation. IP governance is the lever for that shift.',
      )}
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title">▍{t('四階段轉型路徑', 'Four stages')}</h3>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('階段一：基礎強化', 'Stage one: strengthen the base')}</h4>
          <p>{isEn
            ? <>Bring in TIPS Grade-A certification; stand up an internal IP function and a digital management system.<br />Target: measurable growth in filings, and trade-secret leaks down to zero.</>
            : <>導入 TIPS A 級驗證，建置內部 IP 部門與數位管理系統。<br />目標：專利申請有一定成長率、營業秘密外洩率降至零。</>}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('階段二：跨境擴張', 'Stage two: expand across borders')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '優先 PCT 申請核心 AI 技術，與美歐夥伴合作建置「IP 聯盟」。利用 RCEP 與 CPTPP 降低貿易障礙。',
            'File core AI technology through the PCT first, and build IP alliances with partners in the US and Europe. Use RCEP and the CPTPP to lower the trade barriers.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('階段三：AI 生態整合', 'Stage three: integrate into the AI ecosystem')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '與產學研合作建置「AI IP 平台」，共享非核心技術，專注高值應用。融入 ESG 框架，提升國際聲譽。',
            'Build a shared AI IP platform with industry, academia and research institutes — pool the non-core technology and concentrate on high-value applications. Fold it into the ESG framework to build international standing.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h4>{t('階段四：前瞻創新', 'Stage four: get ahead of it')}</h4>
          <p>{t(
            '投資量子與腦機 IP 研發，參與 WIPO 標準制定。董事會設立「未來科技委員會」，每季審核趨勢報告。',
            'Invest in quantum and brain–computer IP, and help write the WIPO standards. Give the board a future technology committee that reviews the trend report each quarter.',
          )}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" style="margin-top:28px;">▍{t('實務成功案例', 'Two that worked')}</h3>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag green">{t('案例 1', 'Case 1')}</span>
        <h3>{t('台積電模式', 'The TSMC model')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '以先進製程專利為護城河，全球專利數領先。將 IP 從硬體延伸至 AI 應用（如 AI 加速器），併購小廠強化軟體 IP。結合收益法與市場法，成功授權多國夥伴。',
          'Advanced-process patents as the moat, and a portfolio that leads globally. TSMC extended its IP from hardware into AI applications such as accelerators, and acquired smaller firms to shore up the software side — then licensed to partners in several countries on a blend of income and market valuation.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ip-card">
        <span class="tag green">{t('案例 2', 'Case 2')}</span>
        <h3>{t('Appier 新創典範', 'Appier, as a startup model')}</h3>
        <p>{t(
          '從創立時即建 IP 清單，專注 AI 行銷模型。盡職調查時 IP 完整性助其市值翻倍。台灣 AI 新創公司可參照，及早納入開源合規，避免募資卡關。',
          'It kept an IP inventory from the start and focused on AI marketing models. When diligence came, the completeness of that IP doubled its valuation. Taiwanese AI startups can follow the same path — bring open-source compliance in early, so fundraising does not stall on it.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="warn-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <strong>{t('未來十年的核心競爭力：', 'The competitive edge for the next decade: ')}</strong>{isEn
        ? <>what decides the outcome is not who invents first, but who can best <strong>govern, trade, protect and monetise IP</strong>. Boards in Taiwan should put IP at the top of the agenda, the legal profession should move into strategic advisory, and the government should get its policies landed faster.</>
        : <>決定勝負的不是誰先發明，而是誰能最好地<strong>治理、交易、保護與實現 IP 價值</strong>。台灣企業董事會應將 IP 列為首要議程，法律界轉型為策略顧問，政府加速政策落地。</>}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEY TERMS -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="terms">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num" style="background:#7c3aed;">{t('術', 'A–Z')}</div>
      <h2>{t('關鍵術語速查', 'Glossary')}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="glossary-grid">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('IP / 智慧財產權', 'IP / intellectual property')}</div><div class="def">{t('Intellectual Property，包含專利、商標、著作權、營業秘密', 'Covers patents, trademarks, copyright and trade secrets')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">Economic moat</div><div class="def">{t('經濟護城河，指企業難以被競爭者複製的持久競爭優勢', 'A durable competitive advantage that rivals cannot easily copy')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">PCT</div><div class="def">{t('專利合作條約，透過單一申請在多個締約國獲得專利保護', 'Patent Cooperation Treaty — one application, protection sought across many member states')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">RBAC</div><div class="def">{t('角色基礎存取控制，根據使用者角色限縮敏感資料存取權', 'Role-based access control — permissions on sensitive data narrowed by the user’s role')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">NDA</div><div class="def">{t('保密協議（Non-Disclosure Agreement），約束資訊外洩', 'Non-disclosure agreement — the contractual constraint against leaking information')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">DTSA</div><div class="def">{t('美國《營業秘密保護法》，允許聯邦法院懲罰性賠償與禁制令', 'The US Defend Trade Secrets Act — allows punitive damages and injunctions in federal court')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">TIPS</div><div class="def">{t('台灣智慧財產管理制度，經濟部推動之 IP 管理驗證制度', 'Taiwan Intellectual Property Management System — an IP management certification run by the Ministry of Economic Affairs')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">DCF</div><div class="def">{t('折現現金流量，收益法估值核心工具，預估未來現金流現值', 'Discounted cash flow — the core tool of the income approach, valuing future cash flows today')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">WACC</div><div class="def">{t('加權平均資本成本，DCF 模型中的風險折現率', 'Weighted average cost of capital — the risk discount rate inside a DCF')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">BEPS</div><div class="def">{t('稅基侵蝕與利潤移轉，跨境 IP 交易需注意的稅務規則', 'Base erosion and profit shifting — the tax rules to watch in cross-border IP deals')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('背景 IP / 前景 IP', 'Background / foreground IP')}</div><div class="def">{t('背景 IP = 簽約前既有技術；前景 IP = 合作期間新創技術', 'Background IP existed before signing; foreground IP is created during the collaboration')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('GPL 污染', 'GPL contamination')}</div><div class="def">{t('開源授權病毒效果，混入商業模型後可能強迫整個產品開源', 'The viral effect of the licence — once mixed into a commercial model it can force the whole product open')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('FTO 分析', 'FTO analysis')}</div><div class="def">{t('Freedom-to-Operate，評估產品是否侵犯第三方專利的分析', 'Freedom to operate — assessing whether a product infringes third-party patents')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('水印嵌入', 'Watermarking')}</div><div class="def">{t('Watermarking，於 AI 生成內容植入不可見數位特徵以追蹤來源', 'Embedding an invisible digital signature in AI output so its source can be traced')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">{t('臨時專利', 'Provisional patent')}</div><div class="def">{t('Provisional Patent，美國制度，低成本先鎖定優先日，12 個月緩衝期', 'A US filing that locks in the priority date cheaply and gives twelve months to follow up')}</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="term">EU AI Act</div><div class="def">{t('歐盟人工智慧法案，分級監管高風險 AI，違規罰款達全球營收 4%', 'The EU’s AI regulation — risk-tiered oversight of high-risk systems, with fines up to 4% of global revenue')}</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUIZ -->
  <section class="ip-section" id="quiz">
    <div class="ip-sec-header">
      <div class="ip-sec-num" style="background:#059669;">{t('測', '?')}</div>
      <h2>{t('自我測驗 — 確認學習成效', 'Self-check — did it land?')}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-card" id="q1">
      <div class="q">{t(
        'Q1｜下列哪一項 IP 估值方法在 AI IP 中最常被使用，且最能反映未來潛力？',
        'Q1｜Which valuation approach is most used for AI IP, and best reflects its future potential?',
      )}</div>
      <ul class="quiz-options">
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q1',false)">{t('A. 成本法（Cost Approach）', 'A. The cost approach')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q1',false)">{t('B. 市場法（Market Approach）', 'B. The market approach')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q1',true)">{t('C. 收益法（Income Approach）', 'C. The income approach')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q1',false)">{t('D. 以上三者效果相同', 'D. All three work equally well')}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q1-correct-fb">{isEn
        ? <>✅ Correct. The income approach uses a DCF of future earnings, which is what captures the growth in AI IP (CAGR &gt; 40%, terminal multiples of 20–40× EBITDA). The cost approach ignores future returns and undershoots badly in a boom.</>
        : <>✅ 正確！收益法透過 DCF 預估未來收益，最能反映 AI IP 的高成長潛力（CAGR &gt; 40%，終值倍數 20–40x EBITDA）。成本法忽略未來收益，在 AI 爆發期常低估價值。</>}</div>
      <div class="quiz-feedback quiz-wrong-fb" id="q1-wrong-fb">{isEn
        ? <>❌ Not quite. The answer is <strong>C, the income approach</strong>. A DCF of future cash flows reflects the growth in AI IP; the cost approach only looks at what has already been spent, and consistently undervalues it.</>
        : <>❌ 答錯了！正確答案是 <strong>C. 收益法（Income Approach）</strong>。收益法透過 DCF 模型預估未來現金流，能充分反映 AI IP 的高成長潛力；成本法只看歷史投入，常低估 AI 應用的爆發性價值。</>}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-card" id="q2">
      <div class="q">{t(
        'Q2｜「GPL 污染」對企業最主要的威脅是什麼？',
        'Q2｜What is the main threat GPL contamination poses to a business?',
      )}</div>
      <ul class="quiz-options">
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q2',false)">{t('A. 導致專利被撤銷', 'A. It gets your patents revoked')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q2',true)">{t('B. 強迫整個商業模型被迫開源，無法專利化', 'B. It can force your entire commercial model open, leaving nothing to patent')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q2',false)">{t('C. 觸發 GDPR 違規罰款', 'C. It triggers GDPR fines')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q2',false)">{t('D. 使商標失效', 'D. It invalidates your trademarks')}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q2-correct-fb">{t(
        '✅ 正確！GPL（GNU General Public License）具有「病毒式」傳染效果，若開源組件混入商業產品，整個產品可能被要求以 GPL 授權開源，導致商業模式失效。',
        '✅ Correct. The GNU General Public License is viral: let a GPL component into a commercial product and the whole product may have to be released under the GPL, which takes the business model with it.',
      )}</div>
      <div class="quiz-feedback quiz-wrong-fb" id="q2-wrong-fb">{isEn
        ? <>❌ Not quite. The answer is <strong>B — it can force your entire commercial model open</strong>. The viral reach of the GPL is the real danger: one GPL component is enough to pull an entire product open, and the business model goes with it.</>
        : <>❌ 答錯了！正確答案是 <strong>B. 強迫整個商業模型被迫開源，無法專利化</strong>。GPL 的「病毒式」傳染性是企業最大威脅——只要混入一個 GPL 組件，整套商業產品都可能被迫開源，商業模式瞬間失效。</>}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-card" id="q3">
      <div class="q">{t(
        'Q3｜台灣企業在中美脫鉤壓力下，建議採取哪種 IP 策略？',
        'Q3｜Under US–China decoupling, what IP strategy should a Taiwanese company take?',
      )}</div>
      <ul class="quiz-options">
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q3',false)">{t('A. 全面轉向中國市場，放棄美國布局', 'A. Pivot entirely to China and give up on US filings')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q3',false)">{t('B. 只保留一套全球統一的 IP 體系以降低成本', 'B. Keep one unified global IP system, to save cost')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q3',true)">{t('C. 建置「雙軌 IP 體系」（美系與中系分離）', 'C. Run a dual-track system, with the US and China sides separated')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q3',false)">{t('D. 完全依賴 WIPO PCT 統一申請', 'D. Rely entirely on a single PCT filing through WIPO')}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q3-correct-fb">{t(
        '✅ 正確！美國 CHIPS Act 與中國《出口管制法》對 AI IP 轉移有相互衝突的限制。台灣企業夾在中間，需建置「雙軌 IP 體系」，將美系與中系 IP 分離管理，避免違規風險。',
        '✅ Correct. The US CHIPS Act and China’s Export Control Law impose restrictions on AI IP transfer that contradict each other. A Taiwanese company sits between them, so the two sides have to be managed as separate tracks.',
      )}</div>
      <div class="quiz-feedback quiz-wrong-fb" id="q3-wrong-fb">{isEn
        ? <>❌ Not quite. The answer is <strong>C — a dual-track system with the US and China sides separated</strong>. The CHIPS Act and China’s Export Control Law contradict each other; only by managing the two separately can you stay compliant with both and avoid sanctions.</>
        : <>❌ 答錯了！正確答案是 <strong>C. 建置「雙軌 IP 體系」（美系與中系分離）</strong>。美國 CHIPS Act 與中國《出口管制法》的規定相互衝突，台灣企業必須將兩套體系分開管理，才能同時合規、避免制裁。</>}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-card" id="q4">
      <div class="q">{t(
        'Q4｜新創公司申請「臨時專利（Provisional Patent）」的主要優點是什麼？',
        'Q4｜What is the main advantage of a provisional patent for a startup?',
      )}</div>
      <ul class="quiz-options">
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q4',false)">{t('A. 可立即獲得正式專利保護，有效期 20 年', 'A. You get full patent protection immediately, for 20 years')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q4',true)">{t('B. 以低成本先鎖定「優先權日」，爭取 12 個月緩衝期完善研發', 'B. It locks in the priority date cheaply and buys twelve months to finish the work')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q4',false)">{t('C. 可自動在全球所有 PCT 締約國取得保護', 'C. It automatically covers every PCT member state')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q4',false)">{t('D. 免除未來的侵權訴訟風險', 'D. It removes the risk of future infringement litigation')}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q4-correct-fb">{t(
        '✅ 正確！臨時專利是美國專利制度，允許以較低成本先取得「優先權日」，有 12 個月緩衝期以完善研發再提交正式申請。這對資源有限的新創公司非常實用。',
        '✅ Correct. A provisional patent is a US filing that secures the priority date at low cost and gives you twelve months to refine the work before filing properly — which matters a great deal when resources are thin.',
      )}</div>
      <div class="quiz-feedback quiz-wrong-fb" id="q4-wrong-fb">{isEn
        ? <>❌ Not quite. The answer is <strong>B — it locks in the priority date cheaply and buys twelve months</strong>. A provisional grants no protection by itself, but it stakes the date at minimal cost, which is how a startup with limited resources still protects an invention.</>
        : <>❌ 答錯了！正確答案是 <strong>B. 以低成本先鎖定「優先權日」，爭取 12 個月緩衝期完善研發</strong>。臨時專利本身不直接授予正式保護，但能以最低成本搶先佔住優先日，讓新創在有限資源下也能保護創新。</>}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-card" id="q5">
      <div class="q">{t(
        'Q5｜根據文章，未來十年企業競爭的決定性因素是什麼？',
        'Q5｜According to the article, what decides competition over the next decade?',
      )}</div>
      <ul class="quiz-options">
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q5',false)">{t('A. 誰先發明新技術', 'A. Who invents first')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q5',false)">{t('B. 誰擁有最多硬體產能', 'B. Who has the most hardware capacity')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q5',true)">{t('C. 誰能最好地治理、交易、保護與實現 IP 價值', 'C. Who governs, trades, protects and monetises IP best')}</li>
        <li onclick="answer(this,'q5',false)">{t('D. 誰能最快完成 TIPS A 級驗證', 'D. Who reaches TIPS Grade-A certification fastest')}</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q5-correct-fb">{t(
        '✅ 正確！作者明確指出：「未來十年，決定勝負的不是誰先發明，而是誰能最好地治理、交易、保護與實現 IP 價值。」這是全文的核心結論。',
        '✅ Correct. The author puts it directly: over the next decade the outcome turns not on who invents first, but on who governs, trades, protects and monetises IP best. That is the conclusion the whole piece builds to.',
      )}</div>
      <div class="quiz-feedback quiz-wrong-fb" id="q5-wrong-fb">{isEn
        ? <>❌ Not quite. The answer is <strong>C — who governs, trades, protects and monetises IP best</strong>. Inventing first is only the starting line; the competitive edge is in managing and monetising IP systematically, which is what makes the moat in the AI era.</>
        : <>❌ 答錯了！正確答案是 <strong>C. 誰能最好地治理、交易、保護與實現 IP 價值</strong>。作者強調：先發明只是起點，真正的競爭力在於能否系統化地管理與變現 IP——這才是 AI 時代的核心護城河。</>}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

